WEBVTT

00:00:00.990 --> 00:00:04.790
Inazuma Eleven GO is about to start!

00:00:13.220 --> 00:00:13.990
Here I come!

00:00:24.150 --> 00:00:25.310
Kurama-senpai!

00:00:25.310 --> 00:00:25.910
Yeah!

00:00:26.530 --> 00:00:26.920
No!

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:37.350
Good work, Sangoku-san!

00:00:37.730 --> 00:00:39.260
And that was a good pass.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:40.490
Thanks!

00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:42.330
Then here's the next one!

00:00:45.790 --> 00:00:50.960
I can't believe this team is now number one in Japan when they were once on the verge of falling apart.

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:53.370
I was right on the mark with them.

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:56.970
I knew these guys would accomplish something big.

00:00:57.240 --> 00:00:58.160
Well.

00:01:00.160 --> 00:01:02.670
Why're you laughing? Geez.

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:03.940
But...!

00:01:05.620 --> 00:01:08.000
They all did really great.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:14.880
<i>This year's Holy Road championship goes to Raimon Jr. High.</i>

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:17.800
<i>We won the championship.</i>

00:01:17.800 --> 00:01:21.520
<i>We brought back real soccer!</i>

00:01:26.320 --> 00:01:29.980
<i>I declare Fifth Sector to be dissolved as of today.</i>

00:01:30.780 --> 00:01:34.230
<i>To all who love soccer...</i>

00:01:34.230 --> 00:01:37.300
<i>Please play soccer as freely as you like.</i>

00:01:41.370 --> 00:01:42.870
He's coming! Hold him back at the sides!

00:01:57.100 --> 00:01:58.330
This is great.

00:03:36.400 --> 00:03:37.770
Tenma!

00:03:40.770 --> 00:03:41.940
You won't get past me!

00:03:42.530 --> 00:03:43.360
Tsurugi!

00:03:48.280 --> 00:03:48.870
How's that?

00:03:50.050 --> 00:03:51.620
Nice save!

00:03:56.210 --> 00:03:57.090
Shin-sama!

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.060
Looks like you're all at it.

00:04:01.810 --> 00:04:02.940
Captain!

00:04:03.370 --> 00:04:04.720
Shin-sama is back!

00:04:12.500 --> 00:04:13.990
Welcome back, Captain.

00:04:13.990 --> 00:04:16.730
We were all waiting for you to come back, Captain.

00:04:17.100 --> 00:04:19.540
Is your leg all right now?

00:04:19.540 --> 00:04:19.910
Yeah.

00:04:20.440 --> 00:04:22.300
I can do some light running.

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:23.400
Don't rush it.

00:04:23.650 --> 00:04:25.740
I know, I won't overdo it.

00:04:26.570 --> 00:04:29.920
We'll get to play soccer with you again.

00:04:29.920 --> 00:04:31.360
I'm so glad!

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:33.170
I'm glad too.

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:36.820
We've got nothing to hold us back now.

00:04:36.820 --> 00:04:39.590
We'll all get to play real soccer from now on.

00:04:40.150 --> 00:04:42.170
Real soccer...

00:04:42.770 --> 00:04:46.210
Captain, I figured out something from playing in the Holy Road.

00:04:46.910 --> 00:04:49.880
I want to learn more about soccer.

00:04:50.970 --> 00:04:53.480
It's good to have you back again.

00:04:53.750 --> 00:04:54.700
Yeah.

00:04:54.700 --> 00:04:59.270
It's a new departure for everyone at Raimon's soccer club!

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:01.250
This is so great!

00:05:01.250 --> 00:05:05.120
Then let's aim for another year of being Japan's number one!

00:05:05.120 --> 00:05:05.880
Yeah!

00:05:05.880 --> 00:05:06.660
Let's do it!

00:05:07.090 --> 00:05:08.820
I know we can!

00:05:08.820 --> 00:05:12.230
You've gotten pretty positive.

00:05:12.770 --> 00:05:13.750
Really?

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:16.060
You don't even realize it?

00:05:16.640 --> 00:05:18.640
I'm so glad I didn't quit!

00:05:19.180 --> 00:05:21.420
Yeah! This is the best team ever!

00:05:22.860 --> 00:05:24.210
I'm so grateful for everyone.

00:05:32.760 --> 00:05:35.930
Feeling nostalgic about our time in the soccer club, Gouenji?

00:05:38.310 --> 00:05:41.730
It's a good thing, having friends you can trust.

00:05:42.580 --> 00:05:43.800
That's what makes Raimon!

00:05:45.320 --> 00:05:46.370
Yeah.

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:07.900
This ball guided me this far.

00:06:11.340 --> 00:06:13.340
Oh, going for a walk?

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:14.060
Yeah.

00:06:14.480 --> 00:06:18.290
Watch out for cars when you cross long roads.

00:06:18.290 --> 00:06:20.390
I know already, Aki-nee!

00:06:20.700 --> 00:06:22.810
I'm not a little kid anymore. I'll be fine.

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:25.420
Let's go, Sasuke.

00:06:27.810 --> 00:06:29.060
Have a good time.

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:30.030
I'll be back later!

00:06:31.680 --> 00:06:33.880
Not a little kid, huh.

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:44.750
Oh, drat!

00:06:46.160 --> 00:06:47.160
Aoi!

00:06:48.160 --> 00:06:49.810
Practicing out here?

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:51.130
I'm out on a walk.

00:06:51.210 --> 00:06:53.620
Sasuke won't move from that spot.

00:06:57.490 --> 00:06:58.680
Here.

00:06:58.680 --> 00:06:59.830
Thanks.

00:07:01.600 --> 00:07:04.940
This is where I first met you, Tenma.

00:07:06.060 --> 00:07:07.220
It is?

00:07:07.220 --> 00:07:07.940
Yeah.

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:11.570
You were practicing by yourself with empty cans lined up on the ground.

00:07:21.460 --> 00:07:23.960
Ew, what a dirty ball.

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:25.460
Sorry!

00:07:25.990 --> 00:07:27.210
Did you get hit?

00:07:27.820 --> 00:07:28.870
Here.

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:30.120
Thanks!

00:07:30.400 --> 00:07:32.400
That's a pretty old ball.

00:07:33.210 --> 00:07:35.290
This is my treasure.

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:38.430
Oh, wow!

00:07:39.020 --> 00:07:39.870
See you!

00:07:39.870 --> 00:07:40.430
Yeah!

00:07:42.920 --> 00:07:45.920
He's from the class next door, isn't he?

00:07:46.640 --> 00:07:47.630
Yeah.

00:07:47.630 --> 00:07:52.430
He's really pumped about taking the entrance test for the junior soccer team.

00:07:53.910 --> 00:07:55.910
Junior soccer team?

00:07:56.620 --> 00:07:58.970
But at that rate...

00:08:02.780 --> 00:08:05.630
See? There's no point in him trying.

00:08:06.450 --> 00:08:12.000
Inazuma Town's soccer level is top class all around the country, you know?

00:08:14.220 --> 00:08:16.930
He doesn't seem good at all.

00:08:26.310 --> 00:08:28.400
He's trying so hard...

00:08:33.340 --> 00:08:37.070
Seeing you so focused on your practice back then...

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:42.060
I don't know why, but watching you made me feel like I was having a lot of fun too.

00:08:42.060 --> 00:08:43.790
Having fun?

00:08:44.890 --> 00:08:47.540
I was just desperate back then.

00:08:48.140 --> 00:08:50.540
I really wanted to get in the team.

00:08:51.750 --> 00:08:52.770
You haven't changed.

00:08:54.230 --> 00:08:57.510
You still work hard at everything, just like that time.

00:08:57.510 --> 00:09:01.110
Well, I only started learning about soccer back then.

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:03.740
I just need to keep working hard at it.

00:09:04.260 --> 00:09:05.270
He's up!

00:09:05.870 --> 00:09:07.710
All right, let's go.

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:08.730
See you later, Aoi.

00:09:09.570 --> 00:09:11.540
Wait up. I'll go too!

00:09:18.230 --> 00:09:19.920
They're practicing!

00:09:20.370 --> 00:09:21.870
Looks fun.

00:09:22.880 --> 00:09:23.660
Rain!

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:27.230
So fast!

00:09:27.230 --> 00:09:29.610
That's a girl.

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:30.840
A girl?

00:09:33.020 --> 00:09:34.300
Easy, easy!

00:09:36.420 --> 00:09:37.050
Bring it!

00:09:37.270 --> 00:09:38.720
Here it comes!

00:09:41.890 --> 00:09:43.790
Rainbow...

00:09:45.920 --> 00:09:47.920
Bubble Shot!

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:55.050
See that, Aoi?

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:56.910
That was an awesome shoot.

00:09:57.270 --> 00:09:59.520
Yeah, awesome!

00:09:59.520 --> 00:10:01.990
Girls can make hissatsu shoots like that?

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:07.000
You won't get it!

00:10:07.000 --> 00:10:08.170
It's mine!

00:10:10.730 --> 00:10:12.090
I'm gonna win!

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.180
No you won't!

00:10:13.180 --> 00:10:14.500
Yes, I got it!

00:10:16.500 --> 00:10:17.510
Pass, pass!

00:10:18.320 --> 00:10:19.260
Rain!

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:26.090
What is it?

00:10:27.210 --> 00:10:28.580
I was remembering things.

00:10:29.860 --> 00:10:30.600
Remembering what?

00:10:31.300 --> 00:10:34.460
About that entrance test way back then.

00:10:44.010 --> 00:10:45.300
Here it is.

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:54.920
I'm getting really nervous.

00:10:56.150 --> 00:10:57.210
Hello!

00:10:59.010 --> 00:10:59.950
You're from earlier!

00:11:02.030 --> 00:11:04.200
There's a lot of people here.

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:05.140
Good luck!

00:11:05.140 --> 00:11:07.020
Y-Yeah.

00:11:07.020 --> 00:11:09.230
I'll watch him for you.

00:11:10.090 --> 00:11:11.370
Really?

00:11:11.370 --> 00:11:12.140
Yeah.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:18.100
Then we'll start the entrance test.

00:11:19.130 --> 00:11:24.490
Steal the ball from the defender and make a goal to pass the first test.

00:11:25.150 --> 00:11:26.620
Awesome.

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:30.400
It's my first time playing soccer on soccer grounds!

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:35.280
You've never played real soccer before?

00:11:35.610 --> 00:11:36.600
Nope.

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:39.850
I've only been practicing by myself.

00:11:41.550 --> 00:11:44.520
I'm surprised you decided to take this test.

00:11:44.520 --> 00:11:46.140
It's pretty hopeless for you.

00:11:49.170 --> 00:11:50.440
It's okay.

00:11:50.440 --> 00:11:52.090
I practiced a whole lot.

00:11:56.610 --> 00:11:58.180
Things will work out!

00:12:14.760 --> 00:12:16.150
All right, you pass!

00:12:16.150 --> 00:12:16.880
Yes!

00:12:17.610 --> 00:12:19.370
Next, #12.

00:12:20.030 --> 00:12:21.460
Next, #13.

00:12:22.390 --> 00:12:23.720
Next, #14.

00:12:27.190 --> 00:12:28.470
All right, you pass.

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:30.420
Next, #15.

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:31.470
Y-Yes, sir!

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:34.550
Good luck.

00:12:36.960 --> 00:12:38.440
Thank you for having me!

00:12:38.440 --> 00:12:40.470
Then here you go!

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.030
One more!

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:55.730
One more!

00:12:59.420 --> 00:13:01.130
Look, he's no good after all.

00:13:01.130 --> 00:13:03.420
He'll never pass with that.

00:13:08.420 --> 00:13:10.210
You practiced so much.

00:13:10.880 --> 00:13:12.720
You'll definitely pass!

00:13:17.610 --> 00:13:18.680
You done yet?

00:13:19.280 --> 00:13:20.440
Not yet!

00:13:20.440 --> 00:13:22.610
One more time, please!

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:24.640
Oh, all right.

00:13:26.110 --> 00:13:28.470
Then want to at least make a shoot?

00:13:30.040 --> 00:13:30.960
Yes, sir!

00:13:32.930 --> 00:13:36.120
All right, let's make a shoot!

00:13:39.900 --> 00:13:40.650
Not yet!

00:13:41.550 --> 00:13:42.380
One more!

00:13:45.420 --> 00:13:46.800
That's enough.

00:13:46.800 --> 00:13:48.340
I just can't pass you.

00:13:48.660 --> 00:13:49.890
Give it up.

00:13:49.890 --> 00:13:50.780
No!

00:13:50.780 --> 00:13:52.760
I'm going to play soccer!

00:13:55.470 --> 00:13:56.120
H-Hey!

00:13:58.970 --> 00:13:59.750
Wow!

00:13:59.750 --> 00:14:00.520
He's fast!

00:14:03.620 --> 00:14:04.480
I won't give up!

00:14:05.260 --> 00:14:08.070
Then this is the last time.

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:10.620
You can do it!

00:14:17.450 --> 00:14:18.670
What's wrong?

00:14:29.590 --> 00:14:31.220
Hey, where are you going?

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:39.100
N-No, stay away...

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:46.320
Huh?

00:14:51.390 --> 00:14:52.150
Are you okay?

00:14:53.500 --> 00:14:54.200
Yeah.

00:14:54.200 --> 00:14:55.480
Thank goodness.

00:14:57.230 --> 00:15:01.580
But I feel a little sorry for that dog.

00:15:08.520 --> 00:15:12.030
Oh no, the entrance test!!

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:16.540
I'm sorry, it's my fault.

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:19.230
No it wasn't, don't worry about it!

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:22.600
I'll just keep practicing and try out again.

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:26.930
That dog was scary.

00:15:26.930 --> 00:15:28.280
Y-Yeah.

00:15:29.220 --> 00:15:32.750
It probably mistook Sasuke as another dog trying to take his territory.

00:15:33.510 --> 00:15:36.230
But it's good nothing bad happened.

00:15:36.230 --> 00:15:38.440
Thanks for chasing it away.

00:15:38.850 --> 00:15:42.080
It turned out okay, but only because I hit it by luck.

00:15:44.050 --> 00:15:46.450
I couldn't do it like that person.

00:15:47.370 --> 00:15:48.450
That person?

00:15:49.070 --> 00:15:53.870
When I was little, someone saved me with this soccer ball.

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:55.500
Saved you?

00:15:56.170 --> 00:15:57.320
Yeah.

00:15:57.320 --> 00:16:02.020
These big wooden boards were about to fall on Sasuke and me.

00:16:03.570 --> 00:16:08.230
But then he kicked the ball from really far away and sent them all flying!

00:16:13.950 --> 00:16:17.350
I want to be like that person.

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:19.170
So that's why you took the entrance test?

00:16:19.170 --> 00:16:20.290
Yeah!

00:16:20.290 --> 00:16:23.030
Our school doesn't have a soccer club, after all.

00:16:23.970 --> 00:16:26.330
I want to play soccer.

00:16:30.810 --> 00:16:32.440
You like it that much?

00:16:32.440 --> 00:16:33.050
Yeah!

00:16:33.570 --> 00:16:37.320
There are all sorts of amazing players out there in the world!

00:16:38.370 --> 00:16:42.420
And my favorite one is the striker who shoots out flames!

00:16:44.250 --> 00:16:46.600
I'd imitate him a lot back at home.

00:16:47.010 --> 00:16:48.210
Like this!

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:54.010
You really do like soccer.

00:16:54.920 --> 00:16:57.600
I'll cheer on your dream with you!

00:16:59.050 --> 00:17:00.120
Okay!

00:17:02.740 --> 00:17:03.740
See ya!

00:17:11.350 --> 00:17:12.210
Hey.

00:17:12.850 --> 00:17:15.250
I'm Sorano Aoi. And you?

00:17:15.870 --> 00:17:18.610
Tenma. Matsukaze Tenma!

00:17:23.010 --> 00:17:26.500
Now that I think of it, it was a pretty crazy challenge.

00:17:27.250 --> 00:17:29.420
It really brings back memories.

00:17:29.420 --> 00:17:33.440
But that's when I started to like soccer.

00:17:33.760 --> 00:17:38.590
I was really surprised when you asked if we could make a soccer club after that.

00:17:39.230 --> 00:17:42.540
We really tried, although it didn't work out in the end.

00:17:43.150 --> 00:17:48.930
I'm a manager now, but maybe one day I'll be a player like her.

00:17:51.150 --> 00:17:52.600
Why not try it?

00:17:56.700 --> 00:18:00.380
Women's soccer is sure to get popular from now on, too.

00:18:05.010 --> 00:18:06.810
Gouenji-san!

00:18:12.040 --> 00:18:14.000
She's good.

00:18:14.310 --> 00:18:15.400
Yeah.

00:18:17.290 --> 00:18:18.520
It's a good sight.

00:18:19.860 --> 00:18:24.330
An era where anyone can enjoy soccer as freely as they like is about to begin.

00:18:25.130 --> 00:18:25.620
Yes.

00:18:26.820 --> 00:18:28.650
Kicking a ball around with other people.

00:18:27.370 --> 00:18:28.650
Move up!

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:33.690
Having fun with the ball is what makes real soccer.

00:18:34.560 --> 00:18:35.130
Yes!

00:18:37.880 --> 00:18:42.710
I've always practiced dribbling at this riverbank.

00:18:43.580 --> 00:18:49.610
So I was really happy when I got into Raimon and got the chance to play soccer with everyone.

00:18:50.800 --> 00:18:51.550
I see.

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:56.770
I really sucked and had trouble keeping up with the upperclassmen at first.

00:18:57.170 --> 00:18:59.850
But I swore I'd get better at it.

00:19:01.200 --> 00:19:04.320
So after that, I came to be able to do all sorts of things, one by one.

00:19:04.880 --> 00:19:08.540
And I got to learn lots about my teammates and players from other teams.

00:19:10.000 --> 00:19:13.990
Just one ball connects everyone's hearts, doesn't it?

00:19:14.330 --> 00:19:14.770
Yeah.

00:19:15.250 --> 00:19:17.920
I'm so glad I met soccer.

00:19:18.530 --> 00:19:22.390
I'll play soccer forever and ever.

00:19:22.880 --> 00:19:23.990
Tenma.

00:19:26.050 --> 00:19:29.100
Take care of soccer from now on, okay?

00:19:29.100 --> 00:19:29.720
Okay!

00:19:46.420 --> 00:19:47.420
Guts!

00:19:47.420 --> 00:19:49.730
You're the goalkeeper, you can't leave your post!

00:19:50.130 --> 00:19:52.290
I want to make a shoot too!

00:19:59.070 --> 00:20:01.770
Dinosaur Break!

00:20:06.250 --> 00:20:06.870
Wow!

00:20:15.100 --> 00:20:17.400
Aw, it got stuck.

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:21.100
How are we supposed to get it when it's that high up, Guts?

00:20:21.840 --> 00:20:22.610
Sorry.

00:20:22.900 --> 00:20:25.720
Now we can't get it...

00:20:26.370 --> 00:20:27.270
Tenma.

00:20:37.350 --> 00:20:38.130
Okay!

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:54.620
All right!

00:20:55.580 --> 00:20:56.400
It fell!

00:20:57.380 --> 00:20:58.530
Thanks!

00:21:00.190 --> 00:21:01.410
Thanks!

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:03.360
Hey, do you want to play with us?

00:21:03.870 --> 00:21:04.750
Can I?

00:21:05.160 --> 00:21:06.630
Of course!

00:21:14.140 --> 00:21:15.040
All right!

00:21:16.730 --> 00:21:18.920
Let's play soccer!

00:22:54.640 --> 00:22:56.570
Big news!

00:22:56.570 --> 00:22:59.410
We were interviewed to be on TV!

00:22:59.410 --> 00:23:03.250
Next on Inazuma Eleven GO, 
 The TV Reporter Is Here!

00:23:03.250 --> 00:23:05.230
This is super-dimensional soccer!

00:23:14.970 --> 00:23:17.590
The Inazuma Eleven GO's proverb today is...

00:23:22.150 --> 00:23:26.780
One ball connects everyone's hearts!

00:23:26.780 --> 00:23:27.630
That's all!
